<mxCell id="m21" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:12px&quot;&gt;views.py&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;[Module outside the view: report.views · 599 lines]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:9.5px&quot;&gt;The UI's read models: one call per view where the view would otherwise stitch several …&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:8.5px;color:#333333&quot;&gt;uses: events&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10;fillColor=#E0E0E0;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1552.5" y="782" width="230" height="92" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="key" value="&lt;b&gt;Key&lt;/b&gt;&lt;table style='font-size:10.5px'&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;width:30px;height:14px;background:#85BBF0;border:1px solid #5B8DB8&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;package &lt;b&gt;onloop.daemon&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;width:30px;height:14px;background:#B9D7F5;border:1px solid #5B8DB8&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;package &lt;b&gt;onloop.detect&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;width:30px;height:14px;background:#DCEBFA;border:1px solid #5B8DB8&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;package &lt;b&gt;onloop.overlay&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;width:30px;height:14px;background:#E0E0E0;border:1px solid #8A8A8A&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;onloop module outside the view, imported by one in it&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;&amp;#x2192;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td&gt;&amp;nbsp;imports (from importer to imported)&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;How this page is made&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Parsed with &lt;code&gt;ast&lt;/code&gt; from &lt;code&gt;src/onloop&lt;/code&gt; at &lt;b&gt;main @ 3fb1271&lt;/b&gt;; no tool installed. A box is a module (its first docstring line, its size); an arrow is an import, resolved to a module. Rows are import depth: a module sits below every module that imports it. Imports of the foundation layer (events, fsutil, github, gitutil, onloop, policy, procs, sqlitedb) are listed in the box as &lt;i&gt;uses&lt;/i&gt; instead of drawn, and package &lt;code&gt;__init__&lt;/code&gt; files that hold only a docstring are left out. A module with more than 6 imports in view draws only those of the next row and lists the rest as &lt;i&gt;also imports&lt;/i&gt;. Long imports of one module share one trunk.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Counts&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;18 modules in view · 4 outside · 34 imports drawn · 4 listed" style="rounded=0;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10.5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=8;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#BFBFBF;fontColor=#1A1A1A;overflow=visible;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2242.5" y="170" width="320" height="400" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
