<mxCell id="c80" value='&lt;b style="font-size:13px"&gt;claude -p --resume &amp;lt;id&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px;color:#E6E6E6"&gt;[Container: stream-json in and out]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:11px"&gt;First output 0.9 s; a one-line answer in 3.5–4.7 s (Haiku). A second process on the same id forks the session silently.&lt;/span&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fillColor=#999999;strokeColor=#8A8A8A;dashed=1;dashPattern=8 4;strokeWidth=2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;overflow=visible;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="985" y="480" width="330" height="220" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
